[[624,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3238181\">4410A80</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238224\">4450B10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238967\">7055B64</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238019\">2710A10</a></p><p>Working from the front left wheelarch,\nremove the differential left inner half shaft using the tools.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Flange</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.820.229.000</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Counter weight</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.821.161.000</p></td></tr></table></div>"],[624,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Fit the left differential internal driveshaft.</p><p><a href=\"#/3238019\">2710A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238967\">7055B64</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238224\">4450B10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238181\">4410A80</a></p>"],[128,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238181\">4410A80</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238224\">4450B10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238967\">7055B64</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238019\">2710A10</a>\n                                           (Left side).</p><p>Undo the drain plugs and drain the manual\ngearbox-differential oil.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Collect the gearbox-differential\noil in a suitable container.</p></aside><p>Remove the left differential internal driveshaft.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Counter weight</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.821.161.000</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Flange</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.820.229.000</p></td></tr></table></div>"],[128,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Refit the differential inner half shaft\nin its seating.</p><p>Clean the transmission fluid drain plugs\nand tighten them to the specified torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Drain plug</p></td><td><p>GEAR CASING PADS</p></td><td><p>M18</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>(Differential side) 1.6 ÷ 2.6</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Drain plug</p></td><td><p>GEAR CASING PADS</p></td><td><p>M22</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>(Mechanical. gearbox. differential/ to engine..) support side\n3.0 ÷4. 8</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Proceed with the refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238019\">2710A10</a>\n                                           (Left side).</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238967\">7055B64</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238224\">4450B10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238181\">4410A80</a>\n                                           .</p>"],[1024,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Position the vehicle on the ramp</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238220\">4450B02</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <strong>- 7055B90 Left front WHEEL ARCH\nLINER - R.R.</strong>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238181\">4410A80</a>\n                                           (Left side).</p><p>1. Disconnect the electrical connection for the left brake pad wear\nsensor.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Left brake pad wear (switch) sensor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3236480\">K20</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Remove the clip fastening the left front brake caliper to the\nbracket.</p><p>3. Undo the bolts (3a) and move the left front brake caliper (3b)\nsideways and secure it.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2069863.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[1024,127,0,"<p>1. Loosen the band (1a) and disconnect the left driveshaft (1b)\nfrom the differential internal driveshaft.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2069864.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[1024,127,0,"<p>1. Using a suitable tool, remove the differential left internal\ndriveshaft.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Collect the manual gearbox oil\nthat comes out in a suitable container.</p></aside><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2069865.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[1024,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Place the left differential internal driveshaft\nback in its housing.</p><p>Connect the left driveshaft to the differential\ninternal driveshaft and tighten the band.</p><p>1. Place the left front brake caliper (1a) back in its housing and\ntighten the bolts (1b) to the recommended torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>-</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>-</p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Place the clip fastening the left front brake caliper to the\nbracket back in its housing.</p><p>3. Connect the electrical connection for the left brake pad wear\nsensor.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2069866.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[1024,127,0,"<p>Proceed with the refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238181\">4410A80</a>\n                                           (Left side).</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <strong>- 7055B90 Left front WHEEL ARCH\nLINER - R.R.</strong>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238220\">4450B02</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Refill the manual gearbox and differential\nfluid \n                                          <strong>- 0010T41 MANUAL GEARBOX OIL - Check level and top up, if necessary</strong>\n                                           .</p><p>Remove the car from the ramps.</p>"]]